Z||000000||BigTurbo87GT||02-13-2001||08:28 PM||||Anybody registered their Turbo Fiero in VA successfully?<BR>How?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Predator||02-14-2001||10:12 AM||||Well I don't know about Virginia, but it can't be harder to pass than Georgia's emissions control. I just passed my emissions test here in Georgia with flying colors. I have a 1985 GT with a Design One Systems Stage II Turbo kit. It was designed to be emissions legal in all states. It came with a new cat with the exhaust system, and the new computer chip is set to be emissions legal. If you have a cat installed, and the stock chip you should be ok.  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||7
Z||000002||ThatRickGuy||02-14-2001||10:15 AM||||If you live in one of the counties that require vehicle inspections and you can't pass, I would suggest heading to BF Prince Wiliams county, find yourself a good ole' country boy, and arrange for a case of beer to be dropped off when he's inspecting your car :P I had troubles with my old '76, but scince I'm in the military I can put Wisconsin tags on my car and avoid inspections  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||BigTurbo87GT||02-14-2001||10:17 AM||||Well, I'm sure I'll pass the gas analyzer with a turbo, I'm not sure if the visual will be ok though.<BR>I just did emmissions yesterday and passed way under limits (limit 152 ppm and I had 9!) of course I don't have the turbo installed yet.<P>------------------<BR>87 GT, Clean near stocker<BR>01 IS300||||reg||1
Z||000004||turbo86se||02-14-2001||01:05 PM||||I don't know his name, but there is someone in VA with a forrest green GT with wide-body kit, tan interior, 5-spd, and a Design One turbo installed. I met him in Williamsburg at the Fiero show last summer. He was trying to sell the Fiero. Curry might know how to get ahold of him. CaptFiero@aol.com<P>Good thing SC doesn't have emmissions testing, my cat-less turbo-charged 86SE wouldn't pass! LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=226077&a=1676320&p=20236791"> ||||reg||1
